---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Crumbs from '../components/Crumbs.astro';
import {paidProduct,supportEmail} from '../lib/paid-product.mjs';
---
<Base title="Deal Lab subscription terms" description="Terms for the public U.S.-only Acquisition Companion Deal Lab paid beta." type="About">
 <Crumbs items={[{title:'Terms'}]}/>
 <article class="narrow">
  <header class="page-header">
   <p class="eyebrow">Public U.S. paid beta</p>
   <h1>Deal Lab subscription terms</h1>
   <p>Last updated October 26, 2026.</p>
  </header>
  <div class="prose">
   <p>These terms cover Acquisition Companion and its optional Acquisition Companion Deal Lab subscription. The service is operated by The Wired Nomad LLC (“we” or “us”). By using the site, you agree to these terms. If you do not agree, do not use the service.</p>

   <h2>Who may subscribe</h2>
   <p>The public educational course is available without an account. The paid beta is publicly available only to customers in the United States who are 18 or older. To subscribe, sign in, choose a plan and confirm U.S.-customer eligibility in hosted Checkout. Sign-in or a U.S. attestation alone does not provide Deal Lab access; access follows canonical active Stripe subscription state.</p>

   <h2>Free education and paid Deal Lab</h2>
   <p>The course and source-linked educational material remain free. A Deal Lab subscription supports interactive analysis, deterministic calculations, acquisition workflows, fictional practice, IC Challenge and associated AI model and compute use. Acquisition Companion is an independent educational product and is not affiliated with or endorsed by referenced creators.</p>

   <h2>Price and recurring billing</h2>
   <p>The single Deal Lab subscription is ${paidProduct.monthlyUsd} per month or ${paidProduct.annualUsd} per year in U.S. dollars. The selected plan renews automatically at that interval until canceled. Hosted Checkout displays the selected plan and recurring price before you confirm payment. Stripe provides Checkout and billing management; Acquisition Companion does not collect or store your card details.</p>

   <h2>Usage allowance</h2>
   <p>Each subscription includes up to {paidProduct.monthlyRequestAllowance} Deal Lab AI requests per UTC calendar month, whether billed monthly or annually. The allowance resets at 00:00 UTC on the first day of each month and does not roll over. A request that reaches the AI service counts, including when the service fails to return a complete answer. Requests denied before reaching the AI service, including invalid or quota-denied requests, do not count. Your Account page shows usage and remaining requests.</p>

   <p>Seller Call Coach is included in the same Deal Lab subscription for introductory seller qualification conversations. Each next-question request or AI call review counts as one request against that same allowance. Use only short non-confidential summaries, never confidential transcripts. Notes and results remain in the active browser session and are not intentionally retained as deal files or conversation records. This version does not record audio or accept uploaded transcripts or documents. A call review reflects unverified summaries and does not establish facts about a business. The existing information restrictions and educational-use limitations apply.</p>

   <p>Deal Workspace is included in the same subscription. Each explicit AI gap review counts as one request against the same monthly allowance. Short sanitized facts, claims, evidence status, questions and actions stay in page memory by default, with optional explicit IndexedDB saves on this device and browser. Local saves are not an encrypted vault or synchronized service, and account deletion does not remove them. Use the workspace delete controls or clear site data to delete device records. Shared-browser account namespaces are not cryptographic isolation. Workspace reviews and manually approved coaching transfers do not verify claims or establish diligence completeness; full call notes and AI output are not automatically saved. The information restrictions above and below apply equally to local saves and AI requests. The <a href="/privacy/#ai-deal-lab">Privacy Policy</a> explains explicit requests, provider retention and local deletion.</p>

   <h2>Cancellation</h2>
   <p>You may cancel recurring billing at any time through Manage billing in your account. Cancellation stops the next renewal. Your access continues through the already-paid billing period, unless applicable law requires otherwise. Cancellation does not delete your Acquisition Companion account. If payment is past due or a subscription has ended, Deal Lab access may be paused or removed according to the verified subscription state.</p>

   <h2>Refunds and billing problems</h2>
   <p>Subscription fees are generally non-refundable after access has been used, except where required by applicable law. If you believe you were charged in error or have a billing problem, contact <a href={`mailto:${supportEmail}`}>{supportEmail}</a>. This policy preserves any mandatory rights you have under applicable law.</p>

   <h2>Accounts and acceptable use</h2>
   <p>Keep access to your sign-in email secure and use your account for your own lawful educational work. Do not share sign-in links, bypass access controls, interfere with the service, or use it to submit information you are not authorized to provide. Do not submit confidential, proprietary, personal or non-public deal information. The beta does not include confidential-information, private CIM, or data-room uploads.</p>

   <h2>Educational information and AI</h2>
   <p>Acquisition Companion is an educational resource. AI can make mistakes, omit important facts or produce incomplete analysis. Calculations depend on the inputs and assumptions shown. The service is not legal, tax, accounting, investment or financing advice, does not provide a financing commitment or lender approval, and does not decide whether a transaction is suitable for you. You are responsible for independently checking information and decisions with appropriate sources and professionals.</p>

   <h2>Availability and changes</h2>
   <p>This is a beta service and features, models and availability may change. The service may be interrupted for maintenance, provider outages, safety or operational reasons. We may change or end a feature or the beta; where practical, we will give notice through the service or account contact. Nothing in this section removes rights or remedies that applicable law provides.</p>

   <h2>Privacy and support</h2>
   <p>Our <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a> explains how account, billing, usage and optional analytics information is handled. For sign-in, subscription, cancellation, privacy or product support, contact <a href={`mailto:${supportEmail}`}>{supportEmail}</a>.</p>
  </div>
 </article>
</Base>
